<title>INDONESIA: Bank International Indonesia 1996 net up.</title>
<headline>Bank International Indonesia 1996 net up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank International Indonesia said on Tuesday it posted a net profit of 260 billion rupiah in 1996, compared with 192.20 billion rupiah in 1995.  </p>
<p>&quot;We have posted 260 billion rupiah last year. It's 35 percent higher than 1995,&quot; Kokaryadi Chandra, vice-president of the bank told reporters after a conference organised by PT ING Barings Indonesia.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
